{"id": "EUVD-2026-95095", "enisaUuid": "c7763073-f240-3bb8-8292-876df29b323b", "description": "Pydantic AI is a Python agent framework for building applications and workflows with Generative AI. From 0.3.4 until 1.107.6 and 2.44.0, OpenTelemetry instrumentation configured with InstrumentationSettings(include_content=False) can still export sensitive agent content through exception.message and exception.stacktrace events, error status descriptions, and model_request_parameters containing instructions or the prompted_output_template. The exposed data is available to readers of the configured telemetry backend and can include tool feedback, provider error bodies, runtime instructions, and structured-output templates even though message attributes are redacted. This issue does not grant new access to agent data, and deployments that do not use include_content=False are not affected by the setting bypass. This issue is fixed in versions 1.107.6 and 2.44.0.", "datePublished": "2026-10-08T16:22:51", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T17:25:18", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/security/advisories/GHSA-4x9p-g9wm-8q7f", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/pull/8403", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/pull/8404", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/pull/8408", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/pull/8428", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/pull/8429", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/commit/4e013c51a50659aba2adf7853bfb22bb77f6a518", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/commit/6b14c74cb281f899a2ae4fae5327111e33f60771", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/commit/7ee27e38ab2e525ca60ff1a25d16413ff989fd79", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/commit/963dec5f70d6f558997fc259356c0090cc5ea487", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/commit/de4e61515327bd80a19cd8552001c30933e6acc3", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v1.107.6", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.44.0"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-107291", "PYSEC-2026-4284", "GHSA-4x9p-g9wm-8q7f", "PYSEC-2026-4275"], "assigner": "GitHub_M", "epss": 0.52, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2908c418-81e6-3855-afb2-f745ff6dcad0", "product": {"name": "pydantic-ai-slim", "vendor": {"name": "Pydantic"}}, "product_version": "0.3.4, < 1.107.6"}, {"id": "79adbead-6459-38e8-a80e-fd9b157eb20e", "product": {"name": "pydantic-ai", "vendor": {"name": "Pydantic"}}, "product_version": "0.3.4, < 1.107.6"}, {"id": "8b151090-4587-3c15-819e-c7aac1612fb5", "product": {"name": "pydantic-ai", "vendor": {"name": "Pydantic"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0b1, < 2.44.0"}, {"id": "a7e076fd-9ff7-319d-b20d-5d62cc245b76", "product": {"name": "pydantic-ai-slim", "vendor": {"name": "Pydantic"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0b1, < 2.44.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "bd451527-8238-337b-9599-b133ed282945", "vendor": {"name": "Pydantic"}}], "isExploited": false}